  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (aspiration level, differences from it, and probability of positive differences) is not present in the verbal report. The individual does not mention the mean of outcomes or any calculation involving differences from a mean. Instead, the justification is based on the perceived safety and certainty of the 3000 Euro outcome, not on the probability of positive deviations from an aspiration level. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason involving aspiration level and positive differences. The reasoning is qualitatively different and does not reflect the rule of the decision reason. Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
